LegalEase – Project Demonstration Phase
1. Purpose
The demonstration phase presents the completed LegalEase AI-powered legal document generator and shows how the system works in real time.

2. Demonstration Steps
Open the Website – Display the LegalEase home page.

User Login – Demonstrate registration and login.

Select Document – Choose a document type such as Rental Agreement or NDA.

Enter Details – Fill in the required information.

Generate Document – Show the AI generating a legal document draft.

Preview & Edit – Review and modify the generated document.

Save/Download – Demonstrate saving or downloading the document.

Explain Features – Highlight the system's main features and benefits.

3. Demonstration Requirements
Working LegalEase website

Computer/laptop and internet connection

Sample user information

Sample legal document

Project presentation slides

4. Expected Result
The demonstration should prove that LegalEase can accept user requirements, generate a customized legal document draft, allow editing, and provide the final document for download.

5. Conclusion
The demonstration confirms that the major functions of the LegalEase project have been implemented and are working as planned.



